        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You call out a desperate wish to the stars to save a friend. You gain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Breath of Life] as an innate arcane spell, which you can cast once per day only while in sentinel form. Interceding in such a direct way temporarily exhausts your constellation's magic, causing you to revert from your sentinel form once the spell is cast.</p>"
          },
