    {
      "fileName": "majestic-proclamation.json",
      "id": "SWkeel82rdttxUD3",
      "name": "Majestic Proclamation",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "SWkeel82rdttxUD3",
        "folder": "qAxIUqU7f0yo5Mtl",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Majestic Proclamation",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in your sentinel form.</p><hr /><p>You announce your name to your enemies, bringing your constellation to bear in a blinding display. Attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Demoralize] all enemies within 30 feet. Demoralize loses the auditory trait and gains the visual trait when used this way. In addition to the regular effects of Demoralize, enemies become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 minute on a successful check (and also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 round on a critical success).</p>\n<p>You can use Majestic Proclamation as a single action if your previous action was @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Starlit Transformation].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Starlit Sentinel Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "sentinels-orbit.json",
      "id": "RtqMWOyfNoruyoxK",
      "name": "Sentinel's Orbit",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "RtqMWOyfNoruyoxK",
        "folder": "qAxIUqU7f0yo5Mtl",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Sentinel's Orbit",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Just as your constellation traverses the sky, so too can you. When in your sentinel form, you gain a fly Speed equal to your land Speed or 20 feet, whichever is higher.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Starlit Sentinel Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "BaseSpeed",
              "predicate": [
                "self:effect:starlit-transformation"
              ],
              "selector": "fly",
              "value": "max(20,@actor.system.movement.speeds.land.value)"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype"
            ]
          }
